including support for the CSOT PP8807HB1-1, a dual-link 10-bit panel
found in LENOVO Legion Y700 Gen4.

Reviewed-by: Neil Armstrong <neil.armstrong@linaro.org>
Signed-off-by: Pengyu Luo <mitltlatltl@gmail.com>
---
