 additional previous changes required by it.
 It comes down to just now having the lines of
    if (sock) {
            WRITE_ONCE(sk->sk_uid, SOCK_INODE(sock)->i_uid);
            WRITE_ONCE(sk->sk_ino, SOCK_INODE(sock)->i_ino);
    }
 below the changed line. ]
